  (v_eva_lpm_id, '7696a2a8-80dd-5b85-88af-dd1ebb4807f8', '0f2dcb7e-68fc-5c51-a3cd-63532b03b393', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Family resemblance as inheritance (DAG K-2) is a paired entry point with observable variation in living things (EvoGen K-2)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '61725b82-5327-5d19-9141-de075fd2ea6b', '4ab63d96-a575-58b6-8af6-d91e29594c32', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Same inheritance-bridge foundation as the DAG K-2 family-resemblance objective, approached from observable variation instead$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'd8ae5ac8-f6af-5753-96b5-61fe1281fad1', 'dea375ae-22ed-5f4f-9544-a2d5a6f4dad5', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Extends the human-chimpanzee body comparison (HumOr K-2) into a conservation-and-stewardship application$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '2ee0124c-e394-5edd-bb42-b94a86afea86', 'd29d9056-9213-59d4-b741-3b2f4f1373df', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Same transmission-chain logic used here for a physical artifact (a folded-paper design) applies to folktale motifs changing across cultures$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '34371da6-f8e7-521d-993c-76278a128df4', 'deb2a0d4-5b79-5d26-9c25-93c64663d09c', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Same need, different solutions logic (HBEC K-2) applied to language instead of material culture (DLCE K-2) -- a tighter content match than material culture alone$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'b2146345-7ac2-51d7-b75f-4d786119cbbe', '8062c6e3-c055-58ff-98f0-94a987b30a75', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Tomasello's own theoretical framework connects these two CCP objectives directly: usage-based language acquisition theory (evaluated at 9-12) is explicitly grounded in the same social-cognitive capacities -- joint attention, intention-reading -- that false-belief/theory-of-mind reasoning (3-5) is an early instance of$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '6cfabec5-e8ce-5632-adf9-c8c9be76915a', 'c8d57078-6382-5060-88cb-51aca87eb476', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$WEIRD-sample critique (HBEC 6-8) extends the existing HBEC/CCP 6-8 pairing on cultural bias in psychological research$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '23f835ff-7871-5529-9af2-db199487181d', 'c8d57078-6382-5060-88cb-51aca87eb476', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Parallels the existing PrimEvo 6-8 / CCP 6-8 association on early social environment and life history; both sit under the trauma-informed sensitive-topic protocol$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '38e5da3f-734a-5e38-8b07-e657c2c3ba3f', 'a71a8c5b-c73c-5be7-94b4-a1e7bc9d8b3e', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Grandmother hypothesis and cooperative-breeding models (HumOr 9-12) are evaluated directly against the comparative primate life-history data this PrimEvo 9-12 objective synthesizes$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '8062c6e3-c055-58ff-98f0-94a987b30a75', '38e5da3f-734a-5e38-8b07-e657c2c3ba3f', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Both are competing-hypothesis position papers requiring engagement with counter-evidence -- shared epistemic form, not shared content$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '18d08c8a-6c20-59c3-b553-790ee466b048', '6f7a78b4-9c51-539a-96fe-026d4f1bc0c3', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: direct reciprocity intuition (fairness sharing, K-2) is prerequisite for indirect reciprocity and reputation (3-5)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '6cfabec5-e8ce-5632-adf9-c8c9be76915a', '534fdfb4-961a-5105-9b9f-3685de88834b', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: testing universality with cross-cultural fairness-game data (6-8) is prerequisite for the D-PLACE institutional-variation analysis (9-12)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '2ee0124c-e394-5edd-bb42-b94a86afea86', 'df2c3d80-310e-501f-a092-fc3aaebc43da', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: embodied transmission-chain experience (3-5) is prerequisite for formalizing the same dynamic as an agent-based model (6-8)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '7f727208-6056-5579-8846-bd54e76474b7', 'ff10760a-35cd-5507-a5ac-3d8bf2f75949', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: artifact-based inference about toolmaker cognition (3-5) is prerequisite for biochemical-signal-based inference about diet and brain evolution (6-8)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'ff10760a-35cd-5507-a5ac-3d8bf2f75949', '38e5da3f-734a-5e38-8b07-e657c2c3ba3f', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: the gut-brain metabolic trade-off logic (6-8) scales from a single organ system to the full life-course trade-offs evaluated at 9-12$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '34862a2c-be12-511d-bdae-d87b376d9ac6', '7f727208-6056-5579-8846-bd54e76474b7', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: deep-time vocabulary (K-2) is prerequisite for reading a tool-type comparison as change over time, not just difference (3-5)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'd29d9056-9213-59d4-b741-3b2f4f1373df', 'ddeccbb4-ce0c-5672-b37a-c2162c1c91ec', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: comparing folktale motifs across cultures (3-5) is prerequisite for quantifying global language diversity and endangerment (6-8)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'deb2a0d4-5b79-5d26-9c25-93c64663d09c', 'd29d9056-9213-59d4-b741-3b2f4f1373df', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: noticing that every word has a history (K-2) is prerequisite for comparing folktale motifs across cultures (3-5)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'f01ab99f-1ddb-55e0-a5bb-93d63f96a39b', '23f835ff-7871-5529-9af2-db199487181d', 'prerequisiteOf', 'asserted', $J$Vertical coherence: understanding field-research ethics (3-5) is prerequisite for the harder ethical judgment of applying a baboon early-adversity model to human ACE research (6-8)$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '7696a2a8-80dd-5b85-88af-dd1ebb4807f8', '61725b82-5327-5d19-9141-de075fd2ea6b', 'isRelatedTo', 'asserted', $J$Both teach parent-offspring resemblance from different strand entry points (DAG: family trees/relatedness; EvoGen: observable variation) -- flagged as near-duplicate content for eva-lpm's next authoring pass, see changes.md$J$, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '4534abdf-741d-5505-8a8b-2151fc8f1728', '2e1ff9cc-1a99-59dd-bc40-6e4903772070', 'isChildOf', 'asserted', NULL, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, 'e6978cf3-788a-5cbb-83ba-3342321d3e6d', '4534abdf-741d-5505-8a8b-2151fc8f1728', 'isChildOf', 'asserted', NULL, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '964f5f64-3a9f-5709-8b5e-6f18da640281', '4534abdf-741d-5505-8a8b-2151fc8f1728', 'isChildOf', 'asserted', NULL, 'accepted'),
  (v_eva_lpm_id, '60b0a6fb-143f-5b95-a886-d559503938e0', '4534abdf-741d-5505-8a8b-2151fc8f1728', 'isChildOf', 'asserted', NULL, 'accepted');
